    {
      "uid": "zhcn:db68b04e39f7c7c12cef118f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "真是的，总是这样……！\n您花钱太大手大脚了！\n今天我一定要说说您――",
      "source_fingerprint": "1062e71668b86e569d55bc7a55ad41424588c1834bc408972b284ccec2fde9ba",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/80/9002/storytimeline_809002004.json",
