      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那边就建游行用的大马路！\n烟花该从哪里发射呢――",
      "source_fingerprint": "3da39437c8cb5b0eb459d4b18c2c7f39ab673f41e12f8665eb0f89d71f6603af",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
